# 06 Results: lag by version, one input (V3 LongBenchmark) through every stack

Generated by `analysis.py`. Lag = best position shift (common.track); "fault" = the arm stopped following (< 1 mm/s for 0.5 s while the target moved > 20 mm/s) before the input ended.

